  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is a vector such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
