  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>On comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Clearly, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p>",
